 Setup</button></div>\n195|  </div>\n196|</section>\n197|\n198|<div id=\"touch-block\" role=\"alert\">\n199|  <div class=\"panel\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n200|    <h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);margin-top:0\">Controller or keyboard required</h2>\n201|    <p style=\"font-weight:800\">Wahoo Wheels 64 is a 10-foot, controller-first racer. This touch-only device has no touch controls by design — plug in a gamepad or keyboard to play.</p>\n202|    <button class=\"btn focused\" id=\"btn-touch-settings\">⚙️ Open Settings</button>\n203|    <p class=\"hint\">Tip: most Bluetooth pads pair in your system settings, then press any button here.</p>\n204|  </div>\n205|</div>","final_result":true,"kind":"output","task_id":"01a17fbb-9642-7922-952e-0363b442ffdd"},"kind":"task_lifecycle","run_stream":{"id":"01a17fba-31ec-7b21-b31a-a331456b2f5f","kind":"run"},"task_id":"01a17fbb-9642-7922-952e-0363b442ffdd","task_stream":{"id":"01a17fbb-9642-7922-952e-0363b442ffdd","kind":"task"}}}
